## API contract

Both backend implementations expose the same routes and response shapes, defined in [`shared/contracts/openapi.yaml`](shared/contracts/openapi.yaml):

- `GET /api/health` → `{ "status": "ok" }`
- `GET /api/example` → `{ "message": string, "receivedAt": string }`

The dashboard page calls `GET /api/example` on load and renders its loading/success/error states from that one call.

